    "html": "<html lang=\"ru\" style=\"height:100%\"><head>\n\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/cdn/default.260923.min.css\">\n\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/cdn/400.260918.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/cdn/600.260918.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/cdn/700.260918.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin=\"\">\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/cdn/900.260918.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin=\"\">\n\n\n  \n<title>Поиск по контрагентам</title>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, user-scalable=yes, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#5fac62\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Результаты поиска контрагентов по фразе &quot;&quot;\">\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"\">\n\n<style>.position-static{position:static!important}</style>\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/cdn/quasar2.260921.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/cdn/user.260921.css\">\n\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/icons/favicon-32x32.png\" sizes=\"32x32\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/icons/favicon-64x64.png\" sizes=\"64x64\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icons/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/icons/site.webmanifest\">\n\n\n\n<meta name=\"csrf-param\" content=\"authenticity_token\">\n<meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"rzFccbWXaw9V4NeRGHHauw9ANa8QvpUSkEc5Qt2s4DjvgyTW53W4tCW1FSOlZU37qC5SuD2ubzSmAeWm30Pmyw\">\n    \n\n\n<style>\n@font-face{font-family:DefaultFont;src:url(/cdn/400.260918.woff2) format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-display:swap}\n@font-face{font-family:DefaultFont;src:url(/cdn/600.260918.woff2) format(\"woff2\");font-weight:600;font-style:normal;font-display:swap}\n@font-face{font-family:DefaultFont;src:url(/cdn/700.260918.woff2) format(\"woff2\");font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-display:swap}\n@font-face{font-family:DefaultFont;src:url(/cdn/900.260918.woff2) format(\"woff2\");font-weight:900;font-style:normal;font-display:swap}\n</style>\n\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"h-100 d-flex flex-column\" id=\"body\">\n\n<header>\n<div class=\"container-xl\">\n<ul class=\"d-flex\" id=\"top-menu\" style=\"max-height:70px\">\n<li class=\"me-auto\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/cdn/images/logo/350x140.webp\" width=\"175\" height=\"70\" alt=\"Чекко\" title=\"Чекко - Проверка контрагентов\" id=\"logo\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"eager\"></a></li>\n<li class=\"d-none d-sm-inline-block align-self-center\"><a class=\"me-4\" href=\"/company/select?code=all\" title=\"Организации\">Организации</a></li>\n<li class=\"d-none d-sm-inline-block align-self-center\"><a class=\"me-4\" href=\"/entrepreneur/select?code=all\" title=\"Индивидуальные предприниматели\">ИП</a></li>\n<li class=\"d-none d-xxl-inline-block align-self-center\"><a class=\"me-4\" href=\"/by\" title=\"Организации и ИП Беларуси\">Беларусь</a></li>\n<li class=\"d-none d-md-inline-block align-self-center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"hl me-4\" href=\"/pro\" title=\"Подписка PRO расширяет функционал сервиса и убирает рекламу\">Подписка PRO</a></li>\n<li class=\"d-none d-lg-inline-block align-self-center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"me-4\" href=\"/business/about\" title=\"Управление страницей вашего бизнеса\">Мой бизнес</a></li>\n<li class=\"d-none d-md-inline-block align-self-center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"me-4\" href=\"/integration/api\" title=\"API для работы с нашими данными\">API</a></li>\n<li class=\"d-none d-lg-inline-block align-self-center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"me-4\" href=\"/databases\" title=\"Базы данных российских компаний\">Базы данных</a></li>\n<li class=\"d-none d-xl-inline-block align-self-center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"me-4\" href=\"/legality\" title=\"Правовые основания размещения информации\">Правовые основания</a></li><li class=\"align-self-center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"ua me-4\" href=\"/login\"><svg fill=\"#fff\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24px\" viewBox=\"0 -960 960 960\" width=\"24px\" style=\"vertical-align:text-top;margin:-2px 8px 0 0\"><path d=\"M235.2-279.59q51-38.52 113.52-60.54 62.52-22.02 131.28-22.02 68.76 0 131.64 22.38 62.88 22.38 113.16 60.42 34.29-41.24 53.31-91.92 19.02-50.69 19.02-108.73 0-131.57-92.78-224.35T480-797.13q-131.57 0-224.35 92.78T162.87-480q0 57.8 18.9 108.49 18.9 50.68 53.43 91.92Zm143.87-199.12q-40.98-40.86-40.98-100.81 0-59.96 40.98-100.94 40.97-40.97 100.93-40.97 59.96 0 100.93 40.97 40.98 40.98 40.98 100.94 0 59.95-40.98 100.81-40.97 40.86-100.93 40.86-59.96 0-100.93-40.86ZM480-71.87q-84.67 0-159.11-32.1-74.43-32.1-129.63-87.29-55.19-55.2-87.29-129.63-32.1-74.44-32.1-159.11 0-84.67 32.1-159.11 32.1-74.43 87.29-129.63 55.2-55.19 129.63-87.29 74.44-32.1 159.11-32.1 84.67 0 159.11 32.1 74.43 32.1 129.63 87.29 55.19 55.2 87.29 129.63 32.1 74.44 32.1 159.11 0 84.67-32.1 159.11-32.1 74.43-87.29 129.63-55.2 55.19-129.63 87.29-74.44 32.1-159.11 32.1Z\"></path></svg>Войти</a></li>\n<li class=\"align-self-center\"><a id=\"menu-button\" class=\"d-block\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-bs-toggle=\"offcanvas\" data-bs-target=\"#menu\" aria-controls=\"menu\"><svg fill=\"#111\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\" height=\"24px\"><path d=\"M 3 5 A 1.0001 1.0001 0 1 0 3 7 L 21 7 A 1.0001 1.0001 0 1 0 21 5 L 3 5 z M 3 11 A 1.0001 1.0001 0 1 0 3 13 L 21 13 A 1.0001 1.0001 0 1 0 21 11 L 3 11 z M 3 17 A 1.0001 1.0001 0 1 0 3 19 L 21 19 A 1.0001 1.0001 0 1 0 21 17 L 3 17 z\"></path></svg></a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"offcanvas offcanvas-end\" tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"menu\">\n<div class=\"offcanvas-header\"><span></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close btn-close-white text-reset\" data-bs-dismiss=\"offcanvas\" aria-label=\"Закрыть\"></button></div>\n<div class=\"offcanvas-body\">\n<ul class=\"nav flex-column\">\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/company/select?code=all\">Организации</a></li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/entrepreneur/select?code=all\">Индивидуальные предприниматели</a></li>\n<hr>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/by\">Беларусь</a></li>\n<hr>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/pro\">Подписка PRO</a></li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/business/about\">Мой бизнес</a></li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/databases\">Базы данных</a></li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/integration/api\">API</a></li>\n<hr>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/legality\">Правовая информация</a></li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sources\">Источники данных</a></li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/agreement\">Пользовательское соглашение</a></li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/privacy\">Политика конфиденциальности</a></li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/offer\">Публичная оферта</a></li>\n<hr>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/login\">Личный кабинет</a></li>\n<hr>\n<li class=\"nav-item\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/feedback\">Обратная связь</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"search-panel\"><div class=\"container-xl\">\n<div class=\"d-flex\" id=\"search-flex\">\n<div class=\"flex-fill\">\n<form id=\"search-form\" action=\"/search\" method=\"get\"><div>\n<input autocomplete=\"off\" id=\"search\" name=\"query\" type=\"search\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Поиск по ИНН, ОГРН, названию или ФИО\" aria-label=\"Поиск\">\n<div class=\"advanced-search-link d-none d-md-block\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"link fs-14\" href=\"/search/advanced\">Расширенный поиск</a></div>\n<button class=\"search-button\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Быстрый поиск\" title=\"Быстрый поиск\">\n<svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#73829f\" d=\"M21.71,20.29,18,16.61A9,9,0,1,0,16.61,18l3.68,3.68a1,1,0,0,0,1.42,0A1,1,0,0,0,21.71,20.29ZM11,18a7,7,0,1,1,7-7A7,7,0,0,1,11,18Z\"></path></svg>\n</button></div></form>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"search-help-dropdown\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-offset=\"0,0\"></div><div class=\"dropdown-menu\" id=\"search-help\">Быстрый поиск по названию организации или ИП / реквизитам / ФИО руководителя или учредителя<br>\nНапример: <span class=\"pseudo\">\"ооо ромашка москва\"</span> или <span class=\"pseudo\">\"7707049388\"</span> или <span class=\"pseudo\">\"кузнецов андрей калуга\"</span>\n<hr>\nТакже у нас есть <a class=\"link\" href=\"/search/advanced\">Расширенный поиск</a> с фильтрами и выгрузкой в Excel</div>\n<div id=\"search-tips-dropdown\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-offset=\"0,0\"></div><ul class=\"dropdown-menu\" id=\"search-tips\"></ul>\n</div></div>\n\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"flex-shrink-0 select-page\"><div id=\"loader\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"container-xl\">\n<div class=\"d-flex flex-row\">\n\n<div class=\"left\" style=\"padding-top:1rem;width:325px;background:var(--bs-gray-100);border-right:none\">\n<div class=\"lsb position-static\" id=\"lsc\" style=\"padding-right:16px\"> \n<div id=\"vue\">\n<div class=\"mt-0 mb-2 pt-0\">\n<q-option-group v-model=\"entity\" class=\"q-gutter-x-lg\" :options=\"[{label: 'Организации', value: 'organizations'}, {label: 'ИП', value: 'entrepreneurs'}]\" type=\"radio\" inline=\"\" color=\"black\" @update:model-value=\"update()\"></q-option-group>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n<q-toggle v-model=\"active_checkbox\" label=\"Только действующие\" color=\"green\" @update:model-value=\"update()\"></q-toggle>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"activity_select_button\" class=\"mb-3\">\n<q-input v-model=\"activity_select_button\" readonly=\"\" outlined=\"\" @click=\"open_activity_modal\">\n<template v-slot:append=\"\">\n<q-btn flat=\"\" round=\"\" dense=\"\" icon=\"close\" size=\"md\" color=\"grey-7\" @click.stop=\"clear_activities()\">\n</q-btn></template>\n</q-input>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"location_select_button\" class=\"mb-2\">\n<q-input v-model=\"location_select_button\" readonly=\"\" outlined=\"\" @click=\"open_location_modal\">\n<template v-slot:append=\"\">\n<q-btn flat=\"\" round=\"\" dense=\"\" icon=\"close\" size=\"md\" color=\"grey-7\" @click.stop=\"clear_locations()\">\n</q-btn></template>\n</q-input>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<q-btn color=\"grey-800\" unelevated=\"\" @click=\"update()\" class=\"me-2\" label=\"Применить\"></q-btn>\n<q-btn flat=\"\" @click=\"reset()\" color=\"grey-7\" label=\"Сбросить фильтры\"></q-btn>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n    \n<div class=\"rc overflow-x-hidden\" id=\"top\" style=\"min-height: 75vh\">\n    \n<div class=\"select-section\" style=\"min-height: 75vh\">\n\n\n<div class=\"d-inline-block d-lg-none mb-3 me-2\" style=\"margin-left:-12px\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:0;border-bottom-left-radius:0;padding-left:8px;padding-right:16px\" id=\"menu-button\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('sb-content').appendChild(document.getElementById('vue')); var sidebar_offcanvas = bootstrap.Offcanvas.getOrCreateInstance(document.getElementById('sb')); sidebar_offcanvas.toggle();\"><span><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/cdn/icons.260717.svg#icon-menu-open\"></use></svg></span>Фильтры</a>\n</div>\n\n<h1 class=\"h2\">Результаты поиска</h1>\n\n    \n<p class=\"mt-4\">Минимальная длина поискового запроса — 4 символа.<br>Попробуйте ещё раз!</p>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"offcanvas offcanvas-start\" tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"sb\" style=\"width: 100%\">\n<div class=\"offcanvas-header\">\n<div class=\"offcanvas-title fw-700\">Поиск по контрагентам</div>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close text-reset\" data-bs-dismiss=\"offcanvas\" aria-label=\"Закрыть\"></button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"offcanvas-body\" id=\"sb-content\"></div>\n</div>\n    \n<div id=\"activity_tree_modal\" class=\"modal\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable\">\n<div class=\"modal-content\">\n<div class=\"modal-header\">\n<div class=\"modal-title\">Виды деятельности</div>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Закрыть\"></button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal-body\">\n<div id=\"vue_activity\">\n\n<q-input class=\"q-mb-md\" v-model=\"activity_search\" placeholder=\"Быстрый поиск\" outlined=\"\">\n<template v-slot:append=\"\">\n<q-btn v-if=\"activity_search\" flat=\"\" round=\"\" dense=\"\" icon=\"close\" size=\"md\" @click=\"activity_search = ''\">\n</q-btn></template>\n</q-input>\n\n<q-tree class=\"activity-tree\" ref=\"activityTreeRef\" :nodes=\"activities\" node-key=\"id\" label-key=\"name\" tick-strategy=\"leaf\" v-model:ticked=\"activity_tree\" v-model:expanded=\"activity_tree_open\" :filter=\"activity_search\" :filter-method=\"activityFilterMethod\" accordion=\"\" no-transition=\"\" icon=\"arrow_forward_ios\">\n<template v-slot:default-header=\"prop\">\n<div><span class=\"tree-code\">{{prop.node.code}}</span> {{prop.node.name}}</div>\n</template>\n</q-tree>\n\n<div class=\"d-flex mt-3\">\n<div class=\"me-auto align-self-center fw-500\">\n<span id=\"activity_select_desc\" class=\"fw-700\">Все виды деятельности</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-inline-block align-self-center\"><q-btn class=\"me-2\" unelevated=\"\" color=\"primary\" @click=\"update()\" label=\"Готово\"></q-btn></div>\n<div class=\"d-inline-block align-self-center\"><q-btn flat=\"\" color=\"grey-7\" @click=\"clear_tree\" label=\"Все виды деятельности\"></q-btn></div>\n</div>\n    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    \n<div id=\"location_tree_modal\" class=\"modal\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable\">\n<div class=\"modal-content\">\n<div class=\"modal-header\">\n<div class=\"modal-title\">Регионы и города</div>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Закрыть\"></button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal-body\">\n<div id=\"vue_location\">\n\n<q-input class=\"q-mb-md\" v-model=\"location_search\" placeholder=\"Быстрый поиск\" outlined=\"\">\n<template v-slot:append=\"\">\n<q-btn v-if=\"location_search\" flat=\"\" round=\"\" dense=\"\" icon=\"close\" size=\"md\" @click=\"location_search = ''\">\n</q-btn></template>\n</q-input>\n\n<q-tree class=\"location-tree\" ref=\"locationTreeRef\" :nodes=\"locations\" node-key=\"id\" label-key=\"name\" tick-strategy=\"leaf\" v-model:ticked=\"location_tree\" v-model:expanded=\"location_tree_open\" :filter=\"location_search\" :filter-method=\"locationFilterMethod\" accordion=\"\" no-transition=\"\" icon=\"arrow_forward_ios\">\n<template v-slot:default-header=\"prop\">\n<div><span class=\"tree-code\" v-if=\"prop.node.id.length == 2\">{{prop.node.id}}</span> {{prop.node.name}}</div>\n</template>\n</q-tree>\n\n<div class=\"d-flex mt-3\">\n<div class=\"me-auto align-self-center fw-500\">\n<span id=\"location_select_desc\" class=\"fw-700\">Все регионы</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-inline-block align-self-center\"><q-btn class=\"me-2\" unelevated=\"\" color=\"primary\" @click=\"update()\" label=\"Готово\"></q-btn></div>\n<div class=\"d-inline-block align-self-center\"><q-btn flat=\"\" color=\"grey-7\" @click=\"clear_tree\" label=\"Все регионы\"></q-btn></div>\n</div>\n    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    \n</div>\n</div>\n\n<script async=\"\" src=\"https://mc.yandex.ru/metrika/tag.js\"></script><script src=\"/cdn/vue3.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/cdn/quasar2.js\"></script>\n\n<script>\n\n/* ═══════════════════════════════════\n   Vue 3 + Quasar — основное приложение (sidebar)\n   ═══════════════════════════════════ */\n\nconst vue_app = Vue.createApp({\n    \n    data() {\n        return {\n            entity: \"organizations\",\n            active_checkbox: true,\n            location_select_button: \"Все регионы\",\n            activity_select_button: \"Все виды деятельности\",\n        }\n    },\n    \n    methods: {\n        update() { update(); },\n        reset() { reset(); },\n        clear_activities() { clear_activities(); },\n        clear_locations() { clear_locations(); },\n        open_activity_modal() { open_activity_modal(); },\n        open_location_modal() { open_location_modal(); },\n    },\n\n}).use(Quasar).mount('#vue');\n\n/* ═══════════════════════════════════\n   Vue 3 + Quasar — дерево регионов\n   ═══════════════════════════════════ */\n\nconst vue_location_app = Vue.createApp({\n    \n    data() {\n        return {\n            locations: [],\n            location_tree: [],\n            location_tree_open: [],\n            location_search: \"\",\n            descendantsCache: {},\n        }\n    },\n    \n    watch: {\n        locations: {\n            immediate: true,\n            handler(roots) {\n                const desc = {};\n                const walk = (node) => {\n                    const set = new Set();\n                    if (node.children) {\n                        for (const child of node.children) {\n                            set.add(child.id);\n                            const childSet = walk(child);\n                            childSet.forEach(id => set.add(id));\n                        }\n                    }\n                    desc[node.id] = set;\n                    return set;\n                };\n                for (const root of roots) walk(root);\n                this.descendantsCache = desc;\n            }\n        },\n        location_tree(arr) {\n            const el = document.getElementById('location_select_desc');\n            if (!el) return;\n            el.innerHTML = arr.length > 0\n                ? \"Выбрано регионов и городов: \" + arr.length\n                : \"Все регионы России\";\n        },\n    },\n    \n    methods: {\n    \n        update() { update(); },\n        \n        clear_tree() {\n            this.location_tree = [];\n        },\n        \n        locationFilterMethod(node, filter) {\n            const f = filter.toLowerCase();\n            const name = (node.name || '').toLowerCase();\n            return name.indexOf(f) > -1;\n        },\n    \n    }\n\n}).use(Quasar).mount('#vue_location');\n    \n/* ═══════════════════════════════════\n   Vue 3 + Quasar — дерево видов деятельности\n   ═══════════════════════════════════ */\n\nconst vue_activity_app = Vue.createApp({\n    \n    data() {\n        return {\n            activities: [],\n            activity_tree: [],\n            activity_tree_open: [],\n            activity_search: \"\",\n            descendantsCache: {},\n        }\n    },\n    \n    watch: {\n        activities: {\n            immediate: true,\n            handler(roots) {\n                const desc = {};\n                const walk = (node) => {\n                    const set = new Set();\n                    if (node.children) {\n                        for (const child of node.children) {\n                            set.add(child.id);\n                            const childSet = walk(child);\n                            childSet.forEach(id => set.add(id));\n                        }\n                    }\n                    desc[node.id] = set;\n                    return set;\n                };\n                for (const root of roots) walk(root);\n                this.descendantsCache = desc;\n            }\n        },\n        activity_tree(arr) {\n            const el = document.getElementById('activity_select_desc');\n            if (!el) return;\n            el.innerHTML = arr.length > 0\n                ? \"Выбрано видов деятельности: \" + arr.length\n                : \"Все виды деятельности\";\n        },\n    },\n    \n    methods: {\n    \n        update() { update(); },\n        \n        clear_tree() {\n            this.activity_tree = [];\n        },\n        \n        activityFilterMethod(node, filter) {\n            const f = filter.toLowerCase();\n            const name = (node.name || '').toLowerCase();\n            const code = (node.code || '').toLowerCase();\n            return name.indexOf(f) > -1 || code.indexOf(f) > -1;\n        },\n    \n    }\n\n}).use(Quasar).mount('#vue_activity');\n\n/* ═══════════════════════════════════\n   Общие функции\n   ═══════════════════════════════════ */\n    \nfunction open_activity_modal() {\n    const openModal = () => {\n        bootstrap.Modal.getOrCreateInstance(document.getElementById('activity_tree_modal')).show();\n    };\n    if (activityDataLoaded) {\n        openModal();\n        return;\n    }\n    activityDataLoaded = true;\n    loadScript('/cdn/activity_data.js').then(() => {\n        vue_activity_app.activities = JSON.parse(activity_data);\n        vue_activity_app.$nextTick(openModal);\n    });\n}\n\nfunction open_location_modal() {\n    const openModal = () => {\n        bootstrap.Modal.getOrCreateInstance(document.getElementById('location_tree_modal')).show();\n    };\n    if (locationDataLoaded) {\n        openModal();\n        return;\n    }\n    locationDataLoaded = true;\n    loadScript('/cdn/location_data.js').then(() => {\n        vue_location_app.locations = JSON.parse(location_data);\n        vue_location_app.$nextTick(openModal);\n    });\n}\n    \n// Ленивая загрузка JS-файла\nfunction loadScript(src) {\n    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n        const script = document.createElement('script');\n        script.src = src;\n        script.onload = resolve;\n        script.onerror = reject;\n        document.head.appendChild(script);\n    });\n}\n\n// Флаги, чтобы не грузить повторно\nlet activityDataLoaded = false;\nlet locationDataLoaded = false;\n\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n\n    document.getElementById('sb').addEventListener('hide.bs.offcanvas', event => {\n        document.getElementById('lsc').appendChild(document.getElementById('vue'));\n    });\n    \n});\n\n// Возвращает массив листьев плюс id всех родителей, у которых\n// все потомки тикнуты. Используется перед отправкой в бэкенд,\n// чтобы фильтр Elastic срабатывал и по кодам разделов целиком.\nfunction withFullyTickedAncestors(tickedArray, descendantsCache) {\n    const ticked = new Set(tickedArray);\n    const result = new Set(tickedArray);\n    for (const id in descendantsCache) {\n        const descs = descendantsCache[id];\n        if (descs.size === 0) continue;\n        let allTicked = true;\n        for (const d of descs) {\n            if (!ticked.has(d)) { allTicked = false; break; }\n        }\n        if (allTicked) result.add(id);\n    }\n    return Array.from(result);\n}\n\nfunction update() {\n    \n    document.getElementById('loader').setAttribute('style', '');\n    \n    url = url_remove_key('page', window.location.href);\n    \n    var search_data = {};\n    \n    search_data['entity'] = vue_app.entity;\n    search_data['active'] = vue_app.active_checkbox;\n    search_data['activities'] = withFullyTickedAncestors(\n        vue_activity_app.activity_tree,\n        vue_activity_app.descendantsCache\n    );\n    search_data['locations'] = withFullyTickedAncestors(\n        vue_location_app.location_tree,\n        vue_location_app.descendantsCache\n    );\n    \n    localStorage.setItem(\"search\", JSON.stringify(search_data));\n    \n    var local_storage_update_request = new XMLHttpRequest();         \n    local_storage_update_request.open('POST', '/local-storage/update/search');\n    local_storage_update_request.setRequestHeader('Content-type', 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded');\n    local_storage_update_request.onreadystatechange = function() {\n        if (local_storage_update_request.readyState === XMLHttpRequest.DONE) {\n        if (local_storage_update_request.readyState == 4 && local_storage_update_request.status == 200) {\n            window.location.href = url;\n\t\t} else {\n        }};};\n    local_storage_update_request.send('data='+JSON.stringify(search_data));\n}\n    \nfunction reset() {\n    \n    document.getElementById('loader').setAttribute('style', '');\n    \n    url = url_remove_key('page', window.location.href);\n    \n    var search_data = {};\n    \n    search_data['entity'] = 'organizations';\n    search_data['active'] = 'true';\n    search_data['activities'] = [];\n    search_data['locations'] = [];\n    \n    localStorage.setItem(\"search\", JSON.stringify(search_data));\n    \n    var local_storage_update_request = new XMLHttpRequest();         \n    local_storage_update_request.open('POST', '/local-storage/update/search');\n    local_storage_update_request.setRequestHeader('Content-type', 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded');\n    local_storage_update_request.onreadystatechange = function() {\n        if (local_storage_update_request.readyState === XMLHttpRequest.DONE) {\n        if (local_storage_update_request.readyState == 4 && local_storage_update_request.status == 200) {\n            window.location.href = url;\n\t\t} else {\n        }};};\n    local_storage_update_request.send('data='+JSON.stringify(search_data));\n    \n}\n\nfunction clear_activities() {\n    vue_activity_app.activity_tree = [];\n    update();\n}\n\nfunction clear_locations() {\n    vue_location_app.location_tree = [];\n    update();\n}\n\n</script></main>\n<footer>\n<div class=\"container-xl\">\n<div class=\"bs-row\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"fs-20 mb-2\">Сервис \"Чекко\"</div>\n<a class=\"link-light\" href=\"/legality\">Правовые основания размещения информации</a><br>\n<a class=\"link-light\" href=\"/agreement\">Пользовательское соглашение</a><br>\n<a class=\"link-light\" href=\"/privacy\">Политика конфиденциальности</a><br>\n<a class=\"link-light\" href=\"/offer\">Публичная оферта</a>\n<div class=\"fs-20 mt-4 mb-2\">Контакты</div>\n<a class=\"link-light\" href=\"/feedback\">Отправить сообщение</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-12 col-md-8\"><div class=\"gap-md\"></div><div class=\"gap-md\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"fs-20 mb-2\">Наши преимущества</div>\n<ul><li>•&nbsp;&nbsp;Удобство использования — четкое и структурированное представление ключевых данных контрагентов</li><li class=\"mt-1\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;Анализ связей — узнайте больше о деятельности вашего поставщика или конкурента, изучив аффилированные организации</li><li class=\"mt-1\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;Официальные данные — мы публикуем открытую и общедоступную информацию только из официальных источников</li><li class=\"mt-1\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;Ежедневные обновления — информация из баз ФНС (ЕГРЮЛ и ЕГРИП) обновляется ежедневно</li><li class=\"mt-1\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;Бесплатный доступ — основные данные о компаниях и предпринимателях открыты для всех пользователей</li><li class=\"mt-1\">•&nbsp;&nbsp;API — интеграция данных ФНС, Росстата, ФССП, ФАС и Генпрокуратуры в ваши информационные системы</li>\n</ul><br><a class=\"link-light\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/download/yandex\">Скачать Яндекс Браузер с поиском \"Чекко\"</a><br><a class=\"link-light d-inline-block mt-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BA%D0%BA%D0%BE/oagaeikjnjbjcgelefgmomonfhpidclg\">Скачать расширение для Chrome и Яндекс Браузера</a><br>\n<a class=\"link-light d-inline-block mt-1\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/widget\">Виджет \"Проверенная компания\"</a>\n</div></div><hr><div class=\"text-center mt-4\">© 2019–2026 checko.ru</div></div></footer>\n\n<div id=\"pa\"><div class=\"container-xl pn\"><div class=\"pnt\">Оставаясь на сайте, вы соглашаетесь на использование файлов cookie и обработку персональных данных в соответствии с <a rel=\"